            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><meta charset="utf-8"><style>body{font:13px -apple-system,sans-serif;margin:12px}h1,h2{font-size:15px}</style><h2>Kaiju 1.0.0 RC4</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Dual View: the other Set List selects too:</b> click, ⌘-click or ⇧-click its slots, ⌘A, ⌘C, or drag several at once into the Set List you're editing.
</li>
<li><b>Delete (⌫) initializes the selected Set List slots.</b>
</li>
<li><b>Drag several Set List slots onto one of their own</b> to move the block a few places: the slot you grabbed lands where you let go.
</li>
<li><b>The selected Set List slot is yellow,</b> as on the KRONOS.
</li>
<li><b>Safer imports into a full PCG:</b> empty slots that a Set List slot, a muted track or a Drum Track points at are filled last, and <b>Use Unused Slots</b> never offers a Program the import still plays.
</li>
<li><b>Import no longer brings an empty Drum Track Program</b> (it showed as "Init Program" among the Programs to copy).
</li>
<li><b>New theme: Darker</b> (Settings › Appearance).
</li></ul>]]></description>
